.* DSPOBJD: the objects selected (basic) and one object's whole
.* description (full), a library at a time.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) Quartz Systems 2026
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=KINDCL BASETYPE='CHAR 8'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=SIZECL BASETYPE='CHAR 28'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=POSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 28'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=LIBPOS CLASS=POSCL.
:VAR NAME=LIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=ASPDEV CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='*SYSBAS'.
:VAR NAME=ASPGRP CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='*SYSBAS'.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=OBJ CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJTYPE CLASS=KINDCL.
:VAR NAME=OBJLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=ATRSIZE CLASS=SIZECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=OBJATR CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OWNER CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=PGP CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='*NONE'.
:VAR NAME=UDATTR CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=CRTDATE CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=CRTUSER CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=CRTSYS CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DOMAIN CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=CHGDATE CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=USAGE CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='NO'.
:VAR NAME=LASTUSED CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DAYSUSED CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='0'.
:VAR NAME=RESETDT CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=RESETLN CLASS=TEXTCL VALUE='  Reset date . . . . . . . . . . . . :'.
:VAR NAME=ALWCHG CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='YES'.
:VAR NAME=AUDIT CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='*NONE'.
:VAR NAME=SIGNED CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='NO'.
:VAR NAME=AUTCOL CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='*NONE'.
:VAR NAME=OBJSIZE CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=ASPNUM CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='1'.
:VAR NAME=DAMAGED CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='NO'.
:VAR NAME=SRCFILE CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=RELEASE CLASS=NAMECL.
:LISTDEF NAME=OBJS VARS='OPT OBJ OBJTYPE OBJLIB ATRSIZE OBJTEXT'.
:KEYL NAME=LISTKEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F17 ACTION=TOP.F17=Top
:KEYI KEY=F18 ACTION=BOTTOM.F18=Bottom
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=FULLKEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=BASIC KEYL=LISTKEYS HELP=BASICH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=NONE BOTSEP=NONE.Display Object Description - Basic
:DATA DEPTH=1.
:DATACOL WIDTH=50.
:DATAC.
:DATACOL WIDTH=28.
:DATAC.&LIBPOS.
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH=3.
:DATACOL WIDTH=41.
:DATAC.Library . . . . . . . :   &LIB.
:DATACOL WIDTH=37.
:DATAC.Library ASP device  . :   &ASPDEV.
:DATAC.Library ASP group . . :   &ASPGRP.
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=OBJS SCROLL=YES.
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 5'.5=Display full attributes
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='RETURN 8'.8=Display service attributes
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJ USAGE=OUTPUT.Object
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Type
.* The attribute and the size share a column: the size is right-aligned
.* under its heading at the column's end.
:LISTCOL VAR=ATRSIZE USAGE=OUTPUT.Attribute               Size
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=FULL KEYL=FULLKEYS HELP=FULLH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=NONE.Display Object Description - Full
:DATA DEPTH=1.
:DATACOL WIDTH=50.
:DATAC.
:DATACOL WIDTH=28.
:DATAC.&LIBPOS.
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH=5.
:DATACOL WIDTH=41.
:DATAC.Object . . . . . . . :   &OBJ.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAC.Library  . . . . . :     &OBJLIB.
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAC.Library ASP device . :   &ASPDEV.
:DATAC.Type . . . . . . . . :   &OBJTYPE.
:DATACOL WIDTH=37.
:DATAC.Attribute  . . . . . :   &OBJATR.
:DATAC.Owner  . . . . . . . :   &OWNER.
:DATAC.Library ASP group  . :   &ASPGRP.
:DATAC.Primary group  . . . :   &PGP.
:EDATA.
.* Twelve rows a page; blank rows end a page early as the display does.
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATAC.User-defined information:
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAC.Attribute  . . . . . . . . . . . . . :   &UDATTR.
:DATAC.Text . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . :   &OBJTEXT.
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAC.
:DATAC.Creation information:
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAC.Creation date/time . . . . . . . . . :   &CRTDATE.
:DATAC.Created by user  . . . . . . . . . . :   &CRTUSER.
:DATAC.System created on  . . . . . . . . . :   &CRTSYS.
:DATAC.Object domain  . . . . . . . . . . . :   &DOMAIN.
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAC.
:DATAC.
:DATAC.
:DATAC.Change/Usage information:
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAC.Change date/time . . . . . . . . . . :   &CHGDATE.
:DATAC.Usage data collected . . . . . . . . :   &USAGE.
:DATAC.Last used date . . . . . . . . . . . :   &LASTUSED.
:DATAC.Days used count  . . . . . . . . . . :   &DAYSUSED.
.* A third level of indent: the label is a value, its blanks kept.
:DATAC.&RESETLN.   &RESETDT.
:DATAC.Allow change by program  . . . . . . :   &ALWCHG.
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAC.Auditing/Integrity information:
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAC.Object auditing value  . . . . . . . :   &AUDIT.
:DATAC.Digitally signed . . . . . . . . . . :   &SIGNED.
:DATAC.Authority collection value . . . . . :   &AUTCOL.
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAC.
:DATAC.Storage information:
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAC.Size . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . :   &OBJSIZE.
:DATAC.Object ASP number  . . . . . . . . . :   &ASPNUM.
:DATAC.Object damaged . . . . . . . . . . . :   &DAMAGED.
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAC.
:DATAC.Service information:
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAC.Source file  . . . . . . . . . . . . :   &SRCFILE.
:DATAC.Object level . . . . . . . . . . . . :   &RELEASE.
:EDATAGRP.
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=BASICH.Display Object Description - Help
:P.The objects the name and type select in one library. Type 5 next
to an object to see all of its description, 8 to see where it came
from.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=FULLH.Display Object Description - Full - Help
:P.Everything the system keeps about the object: its owner, when it
was made and changed, by whom, how it is audited and how much storage
it takes. Page down for the rest.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F3 leaves the display, F12 goes back one display.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
